@startuml

title ComponentHub - Cataloguer Adds a Component

actor Cataloguer
participant "Add component page\n(app.js)" as UI
participant "Catalogue client\n(catalogue.js)" as Client
participant "Express API" as API
database "SQLite" as DB

Cataloguer -> UI: Enter component metadata
UI -> UI: Validate type, category and technology
UI -> Client: add(component)
Client -> API: POST /api/components\nAuthorization: JWT
API -> API: Authenticate JWT\nCheck Cataloguer role
alt Not authenticated or not a Cataloguer
  API --> Client: 401/403 error
  Client --> UI: Throw error
  UI --> Cataloguer: Show permission error
else Authorized
  API -> API: Parse component and keywords
  API -> DB: Insert component and keywords transactionally
  DB --> API: New component ID
  API -> DB: Hydrate created component
  DB --> API: Complete component
  API --> Client: 201 created component
  Client -> Client: Merge component into cache
  Client --> UI: Created component
  UI -> Cataloguer: Show success and new component
end
@enduml
